                <mxCell id="ok-1" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=2;dashed=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="lock-server" target="readonly">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="ok-2" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=2;dashed=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="lock-bench" target="readonly">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="ok-3" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=2;dashed=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="lock-profile" target="readonly">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="ok-4" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=2;dashed=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="lock-workspace" target="readonly">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="ok-label" value="Coexist ✓ (read-only sub-agent can coexist with any lane holder)" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=10;fontStyle=2;fontColor=#82b366;fillColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="500" y="540" width="420" height="20" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="rules-box" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fafafa;strokeColor=#666666;dashed=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="40" y="800" width="1320" height="240" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="rules-title" value="Atomic multi-lane lease rules (§3.5.5)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="60" y="810" width="500" height="20" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="rules-text" value="• All actions must call acquire_many(required_lanes); nested single-lane acquisition is forbidden&#10;• Lane acquisition order is fixed: workspace_mutation → server_lifecycle → benchmark_lane → profile_lane (deadlock prevention)&#10;• Atomic acquisition: either acquire all lanes or none (on failure, release acquired lanes and write event_log)&#10;• Lease must have TTL + heartbeat; cannot silently steal lock after timeout, must first write lease_expired event&#10;• acquire_many failure policy: non-blocking + exponential backoff (100ms → 1s → 5s), total wait capped at lease_ttl × 2; on timeout, task transitions to failed and is requeued in scheduler&#10;• On Resume must scan $SESSION_DIR/locks/, include still-valid leases in lock summary to prevent benchmark/profile pollution after recovery&#10;&#10;LockBackend interface contract (§3.5.4):&#10;  - acquire_many(lanes, holder_id, ttl_sec) → Lease    (atomic acquire-all-or-none)&#10;  - heartbeat(lease) → None                            (extend expiry while alive)&#10;  - release(lease) → None                              (verify holder_id, idempotent)&#10;&#10;Default backend: FileLeaseLockBackend ($SESSION_DIR/locks/&lt;lane&gt;.lock with O_CREAT|O_EXCL)&#10;Replaceable backend: existing reliable lock implementations in repo (must satisfy same interface contract)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Courier New;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="60" y="835" width="1280" height="200" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
            </root>
        </mxGraphModel>
    </diagram>
    <diagram id="page-seq" name="4-KEEP Decision Sequence Diagram">
        <mxGraphModel dx="1800" dy="1200" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1600" pageHeight="1200" math="0" shadow="0">
            <root>
                <mxCell id="0"/>
                <mxCell id="1" parent="0"/>
                <mxCell id="s4-title" value="DeepSeek-V4 Marathon — Sequence Diagram of One KEEP Decision&#10;(Executor proposes → Critic reviews → Conductor orchestrates → sub-agent executes → KEEP/REVERT decision)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=16;fontStyle=1" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="1520" height="50" as="geometry"/>
